| Bat (_Pipistrellus_ spp.) | 7 | 12 | 5 | 5 | ~10 | 24 | Vaughan et al. _Mammalogy_ 6e |
| Dog (_Canis familiaris_) | 7 | 13 | 7 | 3 | ~20 | 27 | Evans & de Lahunta, _Miller's_ 4e |
| Cat (_Felis catus_) | 7 | 13 | 7 | 3 | ~22 | 27 | Dyce et al. _Vet Anatomy_ 4e |
| Tiger (_Panthera tigris_) | 7 | 13 | 7 | 3 | ~22 | 27 | Endo et al. 2006 |
| Lion (_Panthera leo_) | 7 | 13 | 7 | 3 | ~25 | 27 | Endo et al. 2006 |
| Sheep (_Ovis aries_) | 7 | 13 | 7 | 4 | ~16 | 27 | Budras et al. |
| Horse (_Equus caballus_) | 7 | 18 | 6 | 5 | ~18 | 31 | Budras et al. _Anatomy of Horse_ 6e |
